```

New private method `handleBusinessCapabilityUpdate(value, wabaId)`:
- Reads `value.current_limit` (the new tier string)
- Finds the `whatsapp_config` by `waba_id`
- Updates `messaging_limit_tier`, `tier_daily_limit`, `limits_synced_at` in DB
- Logs the change at INFO level

> [!NOTE]
> The webhook app subscription for `business_capability_update` must be enabled in Meta's Developer Console under **Webhooks → WhatsApp Business Account → business_capability_update**. This is a one-time manual step outside the codebase.

